<title>USA: Intl Rectifier Q1 shr falls to $0.06.</title>
<headline>Intl Rectifier Q1 shr falls to $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Rectifier Corp. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>		     Unaudited Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>			(In thousands except per-share amounts)</p>
<p>							 Three months ended</p>
<p>								Sept. 30,</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
